<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the</p>
<p>$328,000 Israel Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat 1-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat 2-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
